center">Initial set</td><td align="center">Sequence Identity (%)</td><td align="center">Equivalent positions (%)</td><td align="center">RMSD (&#x000c5;)</td><td align="center">Difference in length</td><td align="center">Final set</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><bold>Annotation</bold></td><td align="center">10,997</td><td align="center">N/A</td><td align="center">&#x02265;60.0</td><td align="center">&#x02264;2.0</td><td align="center">&#x02264;30</td><td align="center">1,879</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><bold>Ligand</bold></td><td align="center">30,126</td><td align="center">&#x02265;30.0</td><td align="center">&#x02265;75.0</td><td align="center">&#x02264;4.0</td><td align="center">&#x02264;50</td><td align="center">4,948</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><bold>Partner</bold></td><td align="center">30,425</td><td align="center">&#x02265;30.0</td><td align="center">&#x02265;75.0</td><td align="center">&#x02264;4.0</td><td align="center">&#x02264;50</td><td align="center">4,613</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><bold>Localize</bold></td><td align="center">30,126</td><td align="center">&#x02265;90.0</td><td align="center">&#x02265;90.0</td><td align="center">&#x02264;2.0</td><td align="center">N/A</td><td align="center">1,936</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>Sequence identity is the percentage of identical residues with respect to the aligned positions in the structural alignment. Equivalent position is the percentage of residues that align within 4 &#x000c5; with respect to the shorter of the two aligned structures. The RMSD is calculated using C&#x003b1; atoms of the two aligned structures.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>